===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|sh|ota|طلاس|tr=talas}}, {{l|ota|طالاز|tr=talaz}}, {{l|ota|تالاز|tr=talaz}}, from {{der|sh|grc|θάλασσα|t=sea}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sh|/tâlaːs/}}
* {{hyph|sh|та|лас}}

===Noun===
{{sh-noun|g=m|head=та̏ла̄с}}

# [[wave]]

====Usage notes====
In Croatian the term is chiefly used expressively in the language of literature, and {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|ва̑л}} is the standard term.

